# Phase 2 - Create ACL

1. Login to ServiceNow.
2. Navigate to:
   System Security → Access Control (ACL)
3. Click New.
4. Select Type = Record.
5. Select Operation = Read.
6. Select Table = Incident [incident].
7. Enable Advanced.
8. Enter a suitable description.

Description:

Restrict incident record access based on the Priority field value.
